  "title": "Answer: consciousness, as the intrinsic nature of the physical",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "2858a152-5071-4ff2-914f-fabcbb7c082f",
      "text": "Consciousness is fundamental. On micropsychism, very basic consciousness of micro-level entities is the intrinsic nature of their physical properties. On cosmopsychism, the conscious universe is the one fundamental individual.",
